/S /P
/E (Seek feedback: Whenever possible, reach out for constructive feedback from recruiters to gain insights on how you interviewed, which will help you enhance future efforts. Remember, your aim is not just to land a job, but to find the right fit for both yourself and the employer.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [6]
